OL,3,GNEWSAMural celebrates life of The Fall
OL,4,Afrontman in home city
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mural celebrating the life of The
OL,7,FFall frontman Mark E Smith has been
OL,8,Funveiled in his home city.
OL,10,FThe large-scale ceramic and glass
OL,11,Fartwork, created by public artist Mark
OL,12,FKennedy, has been installed on the side
OL,13,Fof a building at the junction of Lower
OL,14,FBroughton Road and Great Clowes Street
OL,15,Fin Salford.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
