OL,3,GNEWSAMural celebrates life of The Fall
OL,4,Afrontman in home city
OL,5,
OL,6,FBorn in Broughton, Smith was the
OL,7,Ffounder and frontman of the influential
OL,8,Fpost-punk band. Renowned for his
OL,9,Fdistinctive voice and acerbic lyrics,
OL,10,Fhe became an influential figure in
OL,11,FBritish alternative music, releasing
OL,12,Fmore than 30 albums and inspiring
OL,13,Fgenerations of artists.
OL,15,FHe died in January 2018.
